SUMMARY:30th Annual Toronto Ukrainian Festival
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Vibrant Ukrainian Spirit at the Bloor West Village Toronto Ukrainian Festival!\n🔹 Musical Performances\n🔹 Culinary Delights\n🔹 Cultural Exhibitions\n🔹 Children’s Activities\n🔹 Community Connections \nCome for the Festival\, Come back for the Village. 💙\nThe Ukrainian Festival brings people together in Bloor West Village—but there’s so much more to discover beyond Festival weekend. Come back to shop\, eat\, explore and support the local businesses that make our Village special. \n\nContact Information: **Please note\, the Festival is organized by a separate third party organization to the Bloor West Village BIA. It has a Board of Directors and a committee of organizers. \n🔗 Check out more info and festival schedule here
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/30th-annual-ukrainian-festival/
LOCATION:Bloor West Village\, Bloor Street West and Willard Avenue (South side of the Street)\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6S 1P4\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Ukrainian-FEstival.jpg
END:VEVENT
